{"id":"626954","name":"秘制卤肉饭","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/626954/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肘子","amount":"1个"},{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半根"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肘子加清水姜片葱，煮两小时（撇浮沫、过滤汤汁等等煮制过程忘了拍照）。","img":"images/626954/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切土豆块。","img":"images/626954/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切胡萝卜丁。","img":"images/626954/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"一定要用这样的小洋葱。","img":"images/626954/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切小丁。","img":"images/626954/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加玉米淀粉。","img":"images/626954/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀，是每一粒葱都沾上玉米粉。","img":"images/626954/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/626954/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下沾了玉米粉的洋葱碎。","img":"images/626954/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"别着急翻炒。","img":"images/626954/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"等一边发黄了再翻炒。","img":"images/626954/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"观察色泽。","img":"images/626954/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"越来越深。","img":"images/626954/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"微微有一点点焦糊。我叫ta洋葱酥","img":"images/626954/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"像这样就OK了。盛出备用。","img":"images/626954/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"肘子肉切下来一块晾凉。","img":"images/626954/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"切成大块丁。如果想要品相好，送冰箱冻上一小时在切。","img":"images/626954/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再准备两颗小洋葱切丁。","img":"images/626954/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/626954/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"煸洋葱。","img":"images/626954/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"加胡萝卜。","img":"images/626954/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"加土豆。","img":"images/626954/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"加肘子汤。（肘子汤煮制过程一定要多撇油）","img":"images/626954/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"加海鲜酱油、老抽、盐。","img":"images/626954/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"加冰糖。","img":"images/626954/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"盖盖子焖煮5分钟。","img":"images/626954/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"因为肘子已经煮了2小时，所以要后加肘子肉。","img":"images/626954/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"加煸过的洋葱酥。","img":"images/626954/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"盖盖子小火再焖煮十分钟。土豆绵软了就OK了。","img":"images/626954/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"出锅前加蔬之鲜。","img":"images/626954/step_30.jpg"},{"step":31,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/626954/step_31.jpg"},{"step":32,"desc":"一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/626954/step_32.jpg"}],"tips":"我没有选择五花肉。而是用了肘子。希望这餐能多一些胶原蛋白，少一些脂肪吧！关键还能解馋……嘿嘿😁 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}